WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.083 --> 00:00:02.000
- It's the incomparable Stephen A. Smith.

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:06.375
And to help me with the Week 14 Playoff Picture,
I finally found a worthy sparring partner.

00:00:06.375 --> 00:00:08.125
Stephen A.I.

00:00:08.125 --> 00:00:12.166
[Stephen AI:] Preposterous. Luminous. Frauds.
Creating Playoff Picture.

00:00:12.458 --> 00:00:13.166
- Hello, friends!

00:00:13.166 --> 00:00:15.125
- Hello, enemies.  
- Man, I love you guys.

00:00:15.125 --> 00:00:17.208
- Yous all counted out ole Joe Flacco!

00:00:17.208 --> 00:00:19.541
- No, no, this is too much RIGAMAROLE.

00:00:19.541 --> 00:00:21.333
- [Stephen AI:] Eliminating RIGAMAROLE.

00:00:21.416 --> 00:00:22.500
- Yeah. Okay.

00:00:22.500 --> 00:00:24.791
- [Stephen AI:] Deleting teams forced to start backup QBs.

00:00:24.791 --> 00:00:26.125
- Dagnabbit.

00:00:26.125 --> 00:00:27.416
- The spell is broken...

00:00:27.416 --> 00:00:30.291
- [Stephen AI:] Jaguars, I'm so sorry,
but maybe take a step back.

00:00:30.458 --> 00:00:31.500
- [Stephen A:] Awkward.

00:00:31.500 --> 00:00:33.333
- Someone stop me if I'm out of pocket here,

00:00:33.333 --> 00:00:34.791
but I'm gonna take a step forward.

00:00:35.250 --> 00:00:37.041
But I'm the chill coach that everyone loves...

00:00:37.041 --> 00:00:38.625
- [Stephen AI:] Let's spotlight some young stars.

00:00:38.625 --> 00:00:40.250
- [Stephen A:] Damn, you put some sort of filter on him?

00:00:40.250 --> 00:00:41.541
He looks PHENOMENAL.

00:00:43.708 --> 00:00:47.000
- Mr. Un-un-un-un-un...LIMITED.

00:00:47.000 --> 00:00:49.583
- [Stephen AI:] Sorry, the A.I. is slowly catching up to the Broncos.

00:00:49.583 --> 00:00:53.291
Now adding a fringe team that will lose a Saturday afternoon Wild Card game.

00:00:53.583 --> 00:00:55.708
- No, no! Anything but the playoffs!

00:00:55.708 --> 00:00:57.791
- [Stephen AI:] Okay, moving on to the NFC.

00:00:57.791 --> 00:00:58.708
- [Stephen A:] Do we have to?

00:00:58.791 --> 00:01:00.666
- OH, but I wasn't in the MVP Race episode...

00:01:00.666 --> 00:01:02.208
- [Stephen AI:] Eliminating Seahawks.

00:01:02.208 --> 00:01:04.041
- Eh, we've been fading away for years.

00:01:04.041 --> 00:01:07.041
- [Stephen AI:] Randomizing atrocious NFC South playoff team.

00:01:07.041 --> 00:01:10.000
- Hi? I was told I'm the most reliable player in the division.

00:01:10.000 --> 00:01:12.458
- [Stephen A:] Now let's INGRATIATE some teams that'll make everyone say

00:01:12.458 --> 00:01:14.375
"THEY made the playoffs?!"

00:01:15.166 --> 00:01:16.583
- [Stephen AI:] Watch this, Stephen.

00:01:16.583 --> 00:01:18.000
How about them Cowboys?

00:01:18.000 --> 00:01:20.708
- Stephen A., you stop that witchcraft this instant!

00:01:20.708 --> 00:01:21.916
- [Stephen AI:] Now, you heard it here first.

00:01:21.916 --> 00:01:23.708
The Buffalo Bills will be in the picture.

00:01:23.708 --> 00:01:24.875
- Are we doing, like, a fun one?

00:01:24.875 --> 00:01:26.708
- That take is TOO preposterous!

00:01:26.708 --> 00:01:28.416
Let's pull the plug on Stephen A.I.

00:01:30.208 --> 00:01:31.916
- There can only be one Stephen A.

00:01:31.916 --> 00:01:34.083
- OH NO, IS THIS MY LAST TAKE?!

00:01:34.083 --> 00:01:35.458
- Everyone say cheese!

